            "ordered": true
          },
          {
            "type": "note",
            "text": "$A \\lor B \\land \\lnot C$ при $A = 0, B = 1, C = 0$: $\\lnot C = 1$, $B \\land 1 = 1$, $0 \\lor 1 = 1$."
